# Skill Entity Names and Descriptions
knowledge-skill-first-aid = First Aid
knowledge-skill-first-aid-desc = Proficiency with syringes and basic medical intervention.
knowledge-skill-surgery = Surgery
knowledge-skill-surgery-desc = Proficiency with performing precise surgical procedures quickly.
knowledge-skill-fabrication = Fabrication
knowledge-skill-fabrication-desc = Proficiency in construction and crafting.
knowledge-skill-stamina = Endurance
knowledge-skill-stamina-desc = Physical endurance and resistance to fatigue and stamina damage.

knowledge-skill-unarmed = Unarmed Combat
knowledge-skill-unarmed-desc = Fighting with fists, claws, or martial strikes.
knowledge-skill-bludgeon = Bludgeons
knowledge-skill-bludgeon-desc = Proficiency with heavy blunt weapons like bats and clubs.
knowledge-skill-short-blade = Short Blades
knowledge-skill-short-blade-desc = Proficiency with knives, daggers, and small bladed weapons.
knowledge-skill-long-blade = Long Blades
knowledge-skill-long-blade-desc = Proficiency with swords, machetes, and large blades.
knowledge-skill-polearm = Polearms
knowledge-skill-polearm-desc = Proficiency with spears and thrusting weapons.
knowledge-skill-nonlethal = Non-Lethal Weapons
knowledge-skill-nonlethal-desc = Proficiency with stun batons and non-lethal equipment.
knowledge-skill-tool-combat = Tool Combat
knowledge-skill-tool-combat-desc = Proficiency in utilizing work tools as improvised weapons.
knowledge-skill-shield = Shields
knowledge-skill-shield-desc = Proficiency in blocking damage and parrying with shields.
knowledge-skill-energy = Energy Weapons
knowledge-skill-energy-desc = Proficiency with advanced energy-based melee weapons.

knowledge-skill-marksmanship = Marksmanship
knowledge-skill-marksmanship-desc = Overall aiming speed and steadiness with firearms.
knowledge-skill-pistol = Pistols
knowledge-skill-pistol-desc = Proficiency with one-handed sidearms and handguns.
knowledge-skill-rifle = Longarms
knowledge-skill-rifle-desc = Proficiency with rifles and two-handed ballistic firearms.
knowledge-skill-smg = Submachine Guns
knowledge-skill-smg-desc = Proficiency with automatic submachine guns.
knowledge-skill-shotgun = Shotguns
knowledge-skill-shotgun-desc = Proficiency with pump-action and semi-auto shotguns.
knowledge-skill-sniper = Sniper Rifles
knowledge-skill-sniper-desc = Proficiency with scoped precision long-range rifles.
knowledge-skill-heavy = Heavy Weapons
knowledge-skill-heavy-desc = Proficiency with heavy artillery and machine guns.
knowledge-skill-laser = Laser Weapons
knowledge-skill-laser-desc = Proficiency with laser weaponry and energy rifles.
knowledge-skill-mining = Mining Weapons
knowledge-skill-mining-desc = Proficiency with kinetic accelerators and mining gear.
knowledge-skill-throwing = Throwing
knowledge-skill-throwing-desc = Speed and accuracy when throwing objects.

